.Language=English,English
.PluginContents=DocFile Browser plugin

@Contents
$^#DocFile Browser Plugin 1.02#
$^#Copyright (c) 1999-2002 Igor Pavlov#
   This FAR module allows to work with compound files: MS Office
documents and some other files . Files in the compound file are
handled in the same manner as if they were in a folder.

   ~Getting from document~@ExtractDocFile@

   ~DocFile Browser configuration~@DocFileConfig@



 Web site:  #www.7-zip.org#

 E-mail:    #support@@7-zip.org#

@ExtractDocFile
$ #Getting from document#
    In this dialog you may enter the path to extract files.

@DocFileConfig
$ #DocFile Browser configuration#
    In this dialog you may change following parameters:

 #Plugin Enabled#         Enables / Disables plugin.
